{
  "title": "报告：我国数据库市场规模超500亿元，占全球7.34%",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>19</span><font>2024.07</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>报告：我国数据库市场规模超500亿元，占全球7.34%</h2> <b>2024.07.19</b> <p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">近日，</span><span class=\"wx_search_keyword_wrap\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: var(--weui-LINK); cursor: default; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">中国通信标准化协会<em class=\"wx_search_keyword\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; display: inline-block; vertical-align: super; font-size: 10px; width: 1.2em; height: 1.2em; mask-position: 50% 50%; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-size: 100%; mask-image: url(\"></em></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">发布《数据库发展研究报告（2024年）》。<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">万里数据库作为中国信通院数据库应用创新实验室的成员单位之一，基于数据库的技术研发能力和多年实践经验，</span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 2.27em; color: rgb(180, 21, 28); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">连续三年参与《数据库发展研究报告》编制工作</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">，持续助力数据库产业研究，为数据库产业发展增添动力。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">报告显示，2023年全球数据库市场规模首次突破千亿美金，约为 1010 亿美元，中国数据库市场规模为 74.1 亿美元（约合522.4 亿元人民币），占全球7.34%。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">在新一轮人工智能浪潮驱动下，全球数据库产业变革不断，多强竞争格局逐步形成；得益于国家战略引领，我国数据库产业进入蓬勃发展期和关键应用期。报告称，<span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\">预计到2028年，中国数据库市场总规模将达到 930.29 亿元，市场年复合增长率（CAGR）为 12.23%。2023 年中国公有云数据库市场规模为 320.15 亿元，较 2022 年增速46.1%，中国数据库市场规模稳步增长。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br/></span></span></p><p></p><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">截至2024年6月，全球有共计518家数据库产品提供商，中美企业数量齐头并进，均为167家，分别占比</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">32.2%。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">从发展周期看，全球数据库在21世纪后进入蓬勃发展期，新增企业数量集中在2010-2020年，2020年左右达到发展高峰。2022年以来新增企业数量逐渐减少。我国数据库产业始于20世纪末，2013年后迎来繁荣发展，与全球发展趋势一致。2022年以来企业新增数量呈现回落态势，表明我国数据库产业正从“数量型”向“质量型”转变。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">从人才规模看，全球数据库企业从业技术人员已超10万人，五分之一企业技术人员位于21-50数量区间。我国数据库企业从业技术人员约两万余人，员工数量平均约200人，人才规模逐年扩大，但数据库内核高级开发人才不足十分之一，数量亟待提升。</span></section><p></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">此外，产业方面，报告从市场规模、地域分布、发展周期、人才规模、产品类型、商业模式、开源历程、竞争热点、学术创新以及标准体系等方面形成全球数据库产业十大洞察；技术方面，报告梳理了数据库技术呈现出技术融合创新发展、新兴技术应用落地以及AI与数据库技术双向赋能的三大发展特征，着重介绍了其中12个细分发展方向；应用方面，报告以金融、电信、能源和制造业为代表，研究当前应用现状、问题以及发展前景。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">根据报告，2024年，全球数据库产业、技术、应用呈现如下总体发展态势：</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(2, 30, 170); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></strong></span></p><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(2, 30, 170); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">产业方面，</span></strong>全球数据库产业迈入发展黄金期，企业、产品数量持续走高。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(2, 30, 170); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></strong></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(2, 30, 170); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">技术方面，</span></strong>数据库技术正围绕技术融合创新发展、新兴技术逐步应用落地、人工智能与数据库双向赋能三大主题持续发展，呈现12个细分发展方向。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(2, 30, 170); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></strong></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(2, 30, 170); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">应用方面，</span></strong>数据密集型行业数据库创新应用走深走实，新型数据库有力赋能传统行业数字化转型。金融、电信等数据密集型行业为数据库产品应用创新提供了广泛空间。</span></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
